text "General Computer Textfiles" 8 36 #00ff00
text "Your one-stop shop for all files of a "computery" nature, that cover how to rebuild a piece of computer hardware to do" 8 83 #00ff00
text "something it was never meant to do, or to see someone go really deeply into a computing subject that would cause most" 8 103 #00ff00
text "people to yawn and look for the snack table. Since BBSes were on computers, it was natural for people who used BBSes" 8 123 #00ff00
text "to focus on all aspects of these wonderful machines. The evidence of their interest and their experimentation resides" 8 143 #00ff00
text "below." 8 163 #00ff00
text "Of course, nearly ALL textfiles are computer-related in some fashion, and some subjects might fit here but fit even better" 8 199 #00ff00
text "in another section. For example, you should most definitely check out the " 8 219 #00ff00
text "programming" 488 219 #00ff00
fill 488 220 84 1 #00ff00
text " and " 572 219 #00ff00
text "apple" 604 219 #00ff00
fill 604 220 36 1 #00ff00
text " sections as well, as" 640 219 #00ff00
text "you might not agree with what I decided should go where." 8 239 #00ff00
